Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:06.84,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}在只差一步時跌倒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:10.51,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,以為到極限而消沉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:12.51,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,但我依然堅持前行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.51,0:01:16.31,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,不甘心就這樣結束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.31,0:01:19.27,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,只要閉上雙眼想像
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.31,0:01:19.27,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(106,565,\blur2)\t(565,815,\blur0)}只要閉上{\alpha&HFF&}雙眼想像
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:23.35,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,總能看見你在身旁
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.27,0:01:23.35,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(66,400,\blur2)\t(400,858,\blur0)}總能看見{\alpha&HFF&}你在身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.35,0:01:28.32,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,面帶我最愛的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.32,0:01:30.61,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,安靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:34.49,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,故事還在進行之中
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.61,0:01:34.49,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(2980,3355,\blur3)\t(3355,3772,\blur0)}故事還在進行之中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.49,0:01:36.91,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,安靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.91,0:01:40.87,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,讓我們翻開下一頁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.87,0:01:44.13,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,不用擔心我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:47.80,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,只因心中時刻有你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:50.92,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,總能聽見你的助威
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.92,0:01:52.68,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,讓我變得更加堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.68,0:01:56.10,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,就算覺得堅持不住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.10,0:01:59.85,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,忍不住要流下眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:02.94,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,總能聽見你的助威
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.94,0:02:05.90,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,我一直都感覺良好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:08.86,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,絕對不會輕言放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:15.03,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\t(5700,6180,\alpha&HC8&)}愛的力量多麼神奇
Comment: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ending
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.32,0:21:38.40,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,0)}就算身處遙遠又未知的星球
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.40,0:21:42.53,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,仰望著頭頂的那片陌生的天空
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.53,0:21:46.49,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,就算深愛過的人和許下的諾言
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.49,0:21:49.75,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,還有其他的一切都不在手邊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.75,0:21:54.75,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\t(750,1810,\alpha&H00&)\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}我依然記憶猶新
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.75,0:21:54.75,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,我依然記憶猶新
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:57.88,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}時間之海默默記錄著你的一切
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.75,0:21:57.88,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,時間之海默默記錄著你的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:22:05.05,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\t(690,1840,\alpha&HFF&)\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}你輕輕推開了沉沒在海中的
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.88,0:22:05.05,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,你輕輕推開了沉沒在海中的
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.05,0:22:07.18,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,那扇門
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.18,0:22:08.89,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1100,0)\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}Wanna me Wanna me Wanna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.18,0:22:08.89,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,Wanna me Wanna me Wanna me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.89,0:22:12.98,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}在別人對我有所認知之前
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.89,0:22:12.98,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,在別人對我有所認知之前
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.98,0:22:15.27,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}我實際上
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.98,0:22:15.27,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,我實際上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.27,0:22:17.11,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1840)\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}Gonna me Gonna me Gonna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.27,0:22:17.11,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,Gonna me Gonna me Gonna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.11,0:22:20.07,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,對自己有清楚的認知
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.07,0:22:23.45,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,獨自一人也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.45,0:22:25.24,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1810,0)\3c&HACA69C&\bord6\blur4}隨著季節更替
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.45,0:22:25.24,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,隨著季節更替
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.24,0:22:31.58,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HACA69C&\bord6\blur4}與互相擁抱取暖的某人相遇又離別
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.24,0:22:31.58,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,與互相擁抱取暖的某人相遇又離別
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:39.71,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HACA69C&\bord6\blur4}偶爾流下的淚水被月光照亮
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.58,0:22:39.71,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,偶爾流下的淚水被月光照亮
